      "summary": {
        "text": "Caleb Dean Costner (born March 3, 1993) is an American professional stock car racing driver. He competes part-time in the ARCA Menards Series, driving the No. 85 Ford for City Garage Motorsports. He has previously competed in the NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series, the ARCA Menards Series East, and the ARCA Menards Series West.",
